license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/tgac-vumc/NEURON"
abstract: >-
  NEURON is a containerized Snakemake pipeline for the analysis of nanopore
  sequencing data of brain tumors. Starting from aligned BAM files, it runs the
  Sturgeon v1 and Sturgeon v2 methylation-based CNS tumor classifiers, MGMT
  promoter methylation analysis, copy-number profiling with QDNAseq and tumor
  cell fraction estimation with ACE, and compiles the results into one PDF
  report. An optional timecourse analysis reconstructs these results over the
  sequencing run.
keywords:
  - nanopore sequencing
  - DNA methylation
  - brain tumor classification
  - neuro-oncology
  - Snakemake
  - Apptainer
